Subject: [PATCH] Report the trusted shell's own PID on its screencasts

Copyright (C) 2026 Artur Yakymenko
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

Apply after patches 0001 through 0011 on niri v26.04. The trusted shell connects
over a socket pair, so its credentials are unknown and its wlr-screencopy casts
reported no PID; a shell could not tell its own live glass capture from another
program's. Record the PID of the process the supervisor spawned on that
connection and report it only for screencasts; the connection still claims no
socket credentials anywhere else.

